  "html": "<div id=\"step-q67902\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 5</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>In a regular polygon, all the exterior angles have a measure of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"18\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.393em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2218\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> How many sides does the polygon have?</p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-67902-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"19\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-67902-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\"